            <title>[LU-19726] Increased test output logging for edge case failures.</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19726</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I have seen a few cases of rare test failures that are hard to reproduce locally. The goal of this patch it to add more verbose output to select methods inside test-framework.sh related to shutdown / rebooting of nodes. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;While this proposed fix doesn't directly fix any of the unique failures or examples given below, it should assist with debugging if they arise again in the future. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/fdb63a52-7b4e-40fa-bd6c-9a4b8a3d61b8" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/fdb63a52-7b4e-40fa-bd6c-9a4b8a3d61b8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

